{"5046630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Counterstep Arena", "steam_appid": 5046630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Counterstep Arena is a turn‑based fighter with roguelike progression where you fight through a series of enemies. Gain upgrades, learn new techniques and expand your moveset as you progress. Craft your unique moveset as you advance towards stronger opponents and prove your mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn-based 2D Fighter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5046630/extras/210a55ff54a82303c6739cc393ac78c1.poster.avif?t=1787885517\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5046630/extras/210a55ff54a82303c6739cc393ac78c1.webm?t=1787885517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5046630/extras/210a55ff54a82303c6739cc393ac78c1.mp4?t=1787885517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the opponent without getting hit. Watch the move previews to plan your next step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy the enemies and watch your fight sequence</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5046630/extras/4cf4d55ed1c96311b2b45c19e4bbac24.poster.avif?t=1787885517\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5046630/extras/4cf4d55ed1c96311b2b45c19e4bbac24.webm?t=1787885517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5046630/extras/4cf4